# Nothing in this project is compiled, bundled or installed, so there is no
# build output, lockfile or dependency folder to keep out. What is left is the
# debris that the operating system, the sync client and editors leave lying
# next to the source.

# Windows and OneDrive
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS, should the folder ever be opened from one
.DS_Store
._*

# Editors and their scratch files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Machine-local Claude Code state: which tool permissions this particular
# computer has granted. .claude/launch.json is deliberately NOT ignored - it
# is how the preview server gets started, which is a fact about the project
# rather than about one machine.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json.backup
